sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser<br/>(React client)
  participant C as Cognito<br/>user pool
  participant G as API Gateway<br/>(authorizer)
  participant L as Lambda<br/>function
  Note over B: random code_verifier and state,<br/>code_challenge = SHA-256(code_verifier)
  B->>C: /oauth2/authorize<br/>(code_challenge, state)
  C-->>B: hosted sign-in page
  B->>C: e-mail and password
  C-->>B: redirect: code + state
  B->>C: /oauth2/token<br/>(code, code_verifier)
  C-->>B: ID, access, refresh token<br/>(kept in memory only)
  B->>G: GET /notes<br/>Authorization: Bearer token
  Note over G: verify RS256 signature with<br/>the pool keys (JWKS), issuer,<br/>expiry and route scope
  alt token or scope invalid
    G-->>B: 401 / 403 error envelope<br/>(no Lambda invocation)
  else token valid
    G->>L: event with verified claims
    L-->>G: 200 {"data": [...]}
    G-->>B: 200 response
  end
